//cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/8/7/87870792-e429-4eba-8193-cdce5c7b6c55.jpg?1717013055", "c": [], "v": 0.0, "o": "{T}: Add {C}.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "Liliana's Standard Bearer", "m": "{2}{B}", "t": "Creature \u2014 Zombie Knight", "s": "Core Set 2021", "sc": "m21", "d": "2020-07-03", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bd1c4b4-57b3-4779-9c7c-b23e73e6a74b.jpg?1594252464", "c": ["B"], "v": 3.0, "o": "Flash\nWhen this creature enters, draw X cards, where X is the number of creatures that died under your control this turn.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Dream Tides", "m": "{2}{U}{U}", "t": "Enchantment", "s": "Visions", "sc": "vis", "d": "1997-02-03", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bd292a0-ec08-4250-8d75-0802e985d6e6.jpg?1562277448", "c": ["U"], "v": 4.0, "o": "Creatures don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.\nAt the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player may choose any number of tapped nongreen creatures they control and pay {2} for each creature chosen this way. If the player does, untap those creatures.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Blazing Specter", "m": "{2}{B}{R}", "t": "Creature \u2014 Specter", "s": "Invasion", "sc": "inv", "d": "2000-10-02", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bd397be-0e61-4f41-b0cf-f0c9d2440da7.jpg?1562907074", "c": ["B", "R"], "v": 4.0, "o": "Flying, haste\nWhenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player discards a card.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Forgotten Sentinel", "m": "{4}", "t": "Artifact Creature \u2014 Golem", "s": "Core Set 2021", "sc": "m21", "d": "2020-07-03", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bd39a06-c53a-42c2-b2df-028358f03406.jpg?1594737496", "c": [], "v": 4.0, "o": "This creature enters tapped.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Dune Beetle", "m": "{1}{B}", "t": "Creature \u2014 Insect", "s": "Amonkhet", "sc": "akh", "d": "2017-04-28", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/9/2/923cb904-c725-4d57-bc17-7aa87a7cd8e0.jpg?1543675266", "c": ["B"], "v": 2.0, "o": "", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Sterling Grove", "m": "{G}{W}", "t": "Enchantment", "s": "Invasion", "sc": "inv", "d": "2000-10-02", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/4/0/40b26aa3-8169-4978-9554-bd2fc8e18e3b.jpg?1562907957", "c": ["G", "W"], "v": 2.0, "o": "Other enchantments you control have shroud. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)\n{1}, Sacrifice this enchantment: Search your library for an enchantment card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Nadir Kraken", "m": "{1}{U}{U}", "t": "Creature \u2014 Kraken", "s": "Theros Beyond Death", "sc": "thb", "d": "2020-01-24", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/7/8/7817e039-e509-4b6f-b5a3-deb3769bbdc8.jpg?1581479411", "c": ["U"], "v": 3.0, "o": "Whenever you draw a card, you may pay {1}. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature and create a 1/1 blue Tentacle creature token.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Yuriko, the Tiger's Shadow", "m": "{1}{U}{B}", "t": "Legendary Creature \u2014 Human Ninja", "s": "Commander 2018", "sc": "c18", "d": "2018-08-10", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bd81ae6-e628-447a-a36b-597e63ede295.jpg?1592710334", "c": ["B", "U"], "v": 3.0, "o": "Commander ninjutsu {U}{B} ({U}{B}, Return an unblocked attacker you control to hand: Put this card onto the battlefield from your hand or the command zone tapped and attacking.)\nWhenever a Ninja you control deals combat damage to a player, reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. Each opponent loses life equal to that card's mana value.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "Yotia Declares War", "m": "{1}{R}", "t": "Enchantment \u2014 Saga", "s": "Dominaria United", "sc": "dmu", "d": "2022-09-09", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bd9e99a-ae8c-4323-aa86-b19288c877d4.jpg?1753786914", "c": ["R"], "v": 2.0, "o": "Read ahead (Choose a chapter and start with that many lore counters. Add one after your draw step. Skipped chapters don't trigger. Sacrifice after III.)\nI \u2014 Create a 0/2 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying named Ornithopter.\nII \u2014 Tap any number of untapped artifacts you control. When you do, this Saga deals that much damage to target creature or planeswalker.\nIII \u2014 Up to one target artifact you control becomes an artifact creature with base power and toughness 4/4 until end of turn.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Bladestitched Skaab", "m": "{U}{B}", "t": "Creature \u2014 Zombie Soldier", "s": "Innistrad: Midnight Hunt", "sc": "mid", "d": "2021-09-24", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/b/8/b8a73f77-aab5-47e3-bfc1-97f6374f40fc.jpg?1636683786", "c": ["B", "U"], "v": 2.0, "o": "Other Zombies you control get +1/+0.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Wretched Banquet", "m": "{B}", "t": "Sorcery", "s": "Conflux", "sc": "con", "d": "2009-02-06", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bdaf55b-2de3-4c8a-90ae-9c88c9d00fd7.jpg?1562800483", "c": ["B"], "v": 1.0, "o": "Destroy target creature if it has the least power or is tied for least power among creatures on the battlefield.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Zurgo, Thunder's Decree", "m": "{R}{W}{B}", "t": "Legendary Creature \u2014 Orc Warrior", "s": "Tarkir: Dragonstorm Promos", "sc": "ptdm", "d": "2025-04-11", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bdb3434-0952-4547-800f-b7b63a25c364.jpg?1744666392", "c": ["B", "R", "W"], "v": 3.0, "o": "Mobilize 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, create two tapped and attacking 1/1 red Warrior creature tokens. Sacrifice them at the beginning of the next end step.)\nDuring your end step, Warrior tokens you control have \"This token can't be sacrificed.\"", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "The Fugitive Doctor", "m": "{3}{R}{G}", "t": "Legendary Creature \u2014 Time Lord Doctor", "s": "Doctor Who", "sc": "who", "d": "2023-10-13", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bdba5b9-235c-411b-b031-7f6ff5368158.jpg?1696638652", "c": ["G", "R"], "v": 5.0, "o": "When The Fugitive Doctor enters, investigate.\nWhenever The Fugitive Doctor attacks, you may sacrifice a Clue. When you do, target instant or sorcery card in your graveyard gains flashback {2}{R}{G} until end of turn. (You may cast that card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "Fiery Encore", "m": "{4}{R}", "t": "Sorcery", "s": "Commander 2021", "sc": "c21", "d": "2021-04-23", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bdc3066-de4a-4cc8-9086-f90f55ba8ff5.jpg?1625982990", "c": ["R"], "v": 5.0, "o": "Discard a card, then draw a card. When you discard a nonland card this way, Fiery Encore deals damage equal to that card's mana value to target creature or planeswalker.\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn.)", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "Blood for the Blood God!", "m": "{8}{B}{B}{R}", "t": "Instant", "s": "Warhammer 40,000 Commander", "sc": "40k", "d": "2022-10-07", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bdcc637-8f96-40a5-b815-f90bcc38d908.jpg?1674059361", "c": ["B", "R"], "v": 11.0, "o": "This spell costs {1} less to cast for each creature that died this turn.\nDiscard your hand, then draw eight cards. Blood for the Blood God! deals 8 damage to each opponent. Exile Blood for the Blood God!", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "Ral Zarek", "m": "{2}{U}{R}", "t": "Legendary Planeswalker \u2014 Ral", "s": "Dragon's Maze", "sc": "dgm", "d": "2013-05-03", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/f/c/fcdbb062-0b0b-4b4c-b4db-dd149f744baa.jpg?1562942657", "c": ["R", "U"], "v": 4.0, "o": "+1: Tap target permanent, then untap another target permanent.\n\u22122: Ral Zarek deals 3 damage to any target.\n\u22127: Flip five coins. Take an extra turn after this one for each coin that comes up heads.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Living End", "m": "", "t": "Sorcery", "s": "Time Spiral", "sc": "tsp", "d": "2006-10-06", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3be0ff69-d9f3-4b81-b02f-1360e4064aff.jpg?1562907448", "c": ["B"], "v": 0.0, "o": "Suspend 3\u2014{2}{B}{B}\nEach player exiles all creature cards from their graveyard, then sacrifices all creatures they control, then puts all cards they exiled this way onto the battlefield.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Lorescale Coatl", "m": "{1}{G}{U}", "t": "Creature \u2014 Snake", "s": "Alara Reborn", "sc": "arb", "d": "2009-04-30", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/e/8/e81c31c9-d7d7-4b45-893e-7e36d26c645f.jpg?1562644825", "c": ["G", "U"], "v": 3.0, "o": "Whenever you draw a card, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Hooded Blightfang", "m": "{2}{B}", "t": "Creature \u2014 Snake", "s": "Core Set 2021", "sc": "m21", "d": "2020-07-03", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3becd8e2-677a-4e54-8839-2b9f80573aa1.jpg?1615019043", "c": ["B"], "v": 3.0, "o": "Deathtouch\nWhenever a creature you control with deathtouch attacks, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.\nWhenever a creature you control with deathtouch deals damage to a planeswalker, destroy that planeswalker.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Invasion of Ixalan // Belligerent Regisaur", "m": "", "t": "Battle \u2014 Siege // Creature \u2014 Dinosaur", "s": "March of the Machine", "sc": "mom", "d": "2023-04-21", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/f/a/fa20fc16-e106-4953-ace4-5ac9c7fec97b.jpg?1739654229", "c": ["G"], "v": 2.0, "o": "(As a Siege enters, choose an opponent to protect it. You and others can attack it. When it's defeated, exile it, then cast it transformed.)\nWhen this Siege enters, look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal a permanent card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.", "bi": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/back/f/a/fa20fc16-e106-4953-ace4-5ac9c7fec97b.jpg?1739654229", "bo": "Trample\nWhenever you cast a spell, this creature gains indestructible until end of turn.", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Eliminate the Competition", "m": "{4}{B}", "t": "Sorcery", "s": "Kaladesh", "sc": "kld", "d": "2016-09-30", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bf09460-2e54-4434-ab03-95eef77265dc.jpg?1576381596", "c": ["B"], "v": 5.0, "o": "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice X creatures.\nDestroy X target creatures.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Jokulhaups", "m": "{4}{R}{R}", "t": "Sorcery", "s": "Ice Age", "sc": "ice", "d": "1995-06-03", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bf0d325-5928-4593-8faa-64ffa414cb48.jpg?1562906050", "c": ["R"], "v": 6.0, "o": "Destroy all artifacts, creatures, and lands. They can't be regenerated.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Anrakyr the Traveller", "m": "{4}{B}", "t": "Legendary Artifact Creature \u2014 Necron", "s": "Warhammer 40,000 Commander", "sc": "40k", "d": "2022-10-07", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bf144d8-fc0e-4e21-87b9-4d32b545bead.jpg?1674058593", "c": ["B"], "v": 5.0, "o": "Lord of the Pyrrhian Legions \u2014 Whenever Anrakyr the Traveller attacks, you may cast an artifact spell from your hand or graveyard by paying life equal to its mana value rather than paying its mana cost.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "Merieke Ri Berit", "m": "{W}{U}{B}", "t": "Legendary Creature \u2014 Human", "s": "Ice Age", "sc": "ice", "d": "1995-06-03", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bf47c0a-5c17-47d0-b663-becff62fbdf8.jpg?1562906052", "c": ["B", "U", "W"], "v": 3.0, "o": "Merieke Ri Berit doesn't untap during your untap step.\n{T}: Gain control of target creature for as long as you control Merieke Ri Berit. When Merieke Ri Berit leaves the battlefield or becomes untapped, destroy that creature. It can't be regenerated.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Unsanctioned Ancient Juggler", "m": "", "t": "Stickers", "s": "Unfinity Sticker Sheets", "sc": "sunf", "d": "2022-10-07", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bf70946-5a50-4918-bb61-23be7c2cc75a.jpg?1675457053", "c": [], "v": 0.0, "o": "{TK}{TK} \u2014 Whenever this creature attacks, bolster 1. (Choose a creature with the least toughness among creatures you control and put a +1/+1 counter on it.)\n{TK}{TK}{TK}{TK} \u2014 Indestructible\n{TK}{TK} \u2014 3/2\n{TK}{TK}{TK} \u2014 5/4", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "Ronom Serpent", "m": "{5}{U}", "t": "Snow Creature \u2014 Serpent", "s": "Coldsnap", "sc": "csp", "d": "2006-07-21", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bf81a39-0a6e-4253-81eb-a24f48253343.jpg?1593275002", "c": ["U"], "v": 6.0, "o": "This creature can't attack unless defending player controls a snow land.\nWhen you control no snow lands, sacrifice this creature.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Puncture Blast", "m": "{2}{R}", "t": "Instant", "s": "Eventide", "sc": "eve", "d": "2008-07-25", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bf90b4d-98cf-4953-b6ae-c41d21ab559b.jpg?1562907480", "c": ["R"], "v": 3.0, "o": "Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\nPuncture Blast deals 3 damage to any target.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Undergrowth Recon", "m": "{1}{G}{G}", "t": "Enchantment", "s": "Murders at Karlov Manor", "sc": "mkm", "d": "2024-02-09", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/4/b/4b8a22b8-368f-41e4-8d49-432c6c2ed11e.jpg?1706242095", "c": ["G"], "v": 3.0, "o": "At the beginning of your upkeep, return target land card from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Thada Adel, Acquisitor", "m": "{1}{U}{U}", "t": "Legendary Creature \u2014 Merfolk Rogue", "s": "Worldwake", "sc": "wwk", "d": "2010-02-05", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bfcbeab-7a1e-4dcf-99bf-98f42c2b6a6f.jpg?1562285424", "c": ["U"], "v": 3.0, "o": "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\nWhenever Thada Adel deals combat damage to a player, search that player's library for an artifact card and exile it. Then that player shuffles. Until end of turn, you may play that card.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Riveting Rigger", "m": "{2}{W}", "t": "Artifact Creature \u2014 Cyborg Rigger", "s": "Unstable", "sc": "ust", "d": "2017-12-08", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/b/3bfcd4ec-d3bc-4aeb-824d-dc79543f8700.jpg?1562907486", "c": ["W"], "v": 3.0, "o": "When this creature enters, you may sacrifice another artifact. If you do, put two +1/+1 counters on this creature and it assembles a Contraption. (Put the top card of your Contraption deck face up onto one of your sprockets.)", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "Gold Mine", "m": "", "t": "Land", "s": "Mystery Booster Playtest Cards 2019", "sc": "cmb1", "d": "2019-11-07", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/4/e/4e672729-66f3-469f-a539-0ebd86ea7654.jpg?1582825565", "c": [], "v": 0.0, "o": "{T}: Add {C}.\nLegacy \u2014 {T}, Mark one of Gold Mine's unmarked nodes: Add one mana of any color.\n\u2610, \u2610, \u2610, \u2610, \u2610", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "Dregs of Sorrow", "m": "{X}{4}{B}", "t": "Sorcery", "s": "Tempest", "sc": "tmp", "d": "1997-10-14", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/8/0/80e4203a-ff11-4075-a03a-11448779b413.jpg?1562054971", "c": ["B"], "v": 5.0, "o": "Destroy X target nonblack creatures. Draw X cards.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Scavenger Hunt", "m": "", "t": "Artifact \u2014 Attraction", "s": "Unfinity", "sc": "unf", "d": "2022-10-07", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/c/3c0080c6-a4fc-481c-b7bd-90692deb1873.jpg?1722025589", "c": [], "v": 0.0, "o": "Visit \u2014 Choose \"a weapon,\" \"five or more creatures,\" or \"words or numbers\" at random. You have ten seconds to search your library and reveal a card with the chosen item in its art. If you do, claim the prize Then shuffle.\nPrize \u2014 You get {TK}{TK}, then you may put a sticker on a nonland permanent you own. Sacrifice this Attraction and open an Attraction.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "Desolation Angel", "m": "{3}{B}{B}", "t": "Creature \u2014 Angel", "s": "Apocalypse", "sc": "apc", "d": "2001-06-04", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/4/4/445127d4-8afb-47cf-b2a1-564540b1fdae.jpg?1562910998", "c": ["B"], "v": 5.0, "o": "Kicker {W}{W} (You may pay an additional {W}{W} as you cast this spell.)\nFlying\nWhen this creature enters, destroy all lands you control. If it was kicked, destroy all lands instead.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Blightning", "m": "{1}{B}{R}", "t": "Sorcery", "s": "Shards of Alara", "sc": "ala", "d": "2008-10-03", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/c/3c05e8a2-b7d0-4f24-b2ae-8e4db30e5842.jpg?1562702945", "c": ["B", "R"], "v": 3.0, "o": "Blightning deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker. That player or that planeswalker's controller discards two cards.", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "L"}, {"n": "Theopholos, Order Acolyte", "m": "{3}{W}", "t": "Legendary Creature \u2014 Dwarf Cleric", "s": "Unknown Event", "sc": "unk", "d": "2023-07-29", "i": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/3/c/3c05f4ae-13d3-4495-8a4a-b4d65941537d.jpg?1730163563", "c": ["W"], "v": 4.0, "o": "Mono Eminence \u2014 As the game begins, if Theopholos is your commander and your deck's color identity is mono-white, your starting life total is increased by 10.\nWhenever Theopholos attacks, if your life total is greater than your starting life total, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.\nPartner (You can have two commanders if both have partner.)", "bi": "", "bo": "", "l": "I"}, {"n": "Haunted Crossroads", "m": "{2}{B}", "t": "Enchantment", "s": "Mercadian Masques", "sc": "mmq", "d": "1